  "name": null,
  "problem": "A bag contains a large number of equally-sized buttons, of which $15%$ are white. A random sample of $n=18$ buttons is taken from the bag.\n\nWhat is the mean and variance of $\\overset{^}{\\,p},$ the proportion of white buttons in the sample? Round your answers to $3$ decimal places where appropriate.\n\n*Hint: You may assume that the number of buttons in the bag is significantly larger than the number in the sample.*",
